{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/0f2889c123fbba6f7da46cb7feb45a26.poster.avif?t=1771498737\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/0f2889c123fbba6f7da46cb7feb45a26.webm?t=1771498737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Craft. Sabotage. Survive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the Dark Overlord rules with an iron fist, one alchemist's quest for redemption becomes a divine mission of resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300cTERROR\u300dtype:\u3010A.L.C.H.E.M.Y.\u3011</strong>is a story-driven stealth action immersive sim that puts players in the role of Auronika Cortez, a skilled alchemist turned freedom fighter in a dark  medieval-industrial world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Auronika, you\u2019ll help bring down the tyrants using your forbidden <strong>A.L.C.H.E.M.Y.\u00a0</strong>skills, crafting potions for the resistance and manufacturing magical bombs to directly attack your oppressors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart the regime and turn the tides of secret war - one concoction or explosion at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/0291fd590ffc047ab59feaef28eeb69a.poster.avif?t=1771498737\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/0291fd590ffc047ab59feaef28eeb69a.webm?t=1771498737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/0291fd590ffc047ab59feaef28eeb69a.mp4?t=1771498737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revolutionary Crafting System</strong>: Master the art of medieval alchemistry through an innovative <strong>A.L.C.H.E.M.Y.\u00a0</strong>system. Combine reagents to create powerful concoctions and tools for the resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/6eafebbbd80271c993f766f437252916.poster.avif?t=1771498737\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/6eafebbbd80271c993f766f437252916.webm?t=1771498737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/6eafebbbd80271c993f766f437252916.mp4?t=1771498737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Stealth Gameplay</strong>: Navigate a vertically-stratified city where every shadow could mean survival. Dodge patrols, exploit vantage points, and escape through the underground networks of a society divided by power and privilege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/e8cdcfd6d6160d74ab5558b7b3a9fbe8.poster.avif?t=1771498737\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/e8cdcfd6d6160d74ab5558b7b3a9fbe8.webm?t=1771498737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/e8cdcfd6d6160d74ab5558b7b3a9fbe8.mp4?t=1771498737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morally Complex Narrative</strong>: Experience a story of resistance, redemption, and the price of freedom as Auronika must navigate between her heavenly mandate and the brutal realities of uprising.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3503810?t=1771498737","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/1fd92f92743a689f2a56499ab97d798a3f12855f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771498737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/7e0c08618a4f4f5401bd82c4a50cd202deab3c69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771498737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/7e0c08618a4f4f5401bd82c4a50cd202deab3c69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771498737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4063880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/0f2889c123fbba6f7da46cb7feb45a26.poster.avif?t=1771498737\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503810/extras/0f2889c123fbba6f7da46cb7feb45a26.webm?t=1771498737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Craft. Sabotage. Survive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the Dark Overlord rules with an iron fist, one alchemist's quest for redemption becomes a divine mission of resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stro